 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? Ah, the classic laptop coffee spill. The most important thing is the keyboard, which can get waterlogged really fast. Ha, I'll wait. Take off the battery. Good. Then take the battery out, open the laptop as wide as possible. No problem. Just put it in a bowl of rice for a couple of days. It draws the moisture out. If it' only the front, try a dry erase marker. If it's the keyboard, it's time for a new one.",
